# The list of vouched (or actively denounced) users for this repository.
#
# Only vouched users can open pull requests. Bots (ending with [bot]) and
# collaborators with write access are automatically allowed.
#
# To request a vouch, open a discussion in the Discussions tab describing
# your proposed contribution. A maintainer will vouch you by commenting
# !vouch on your discussion.
#
# Syntax:
#  - One handle per line (without @). Sorted alphabetically.
#  - To denounce a user, prefix with minus: -username
#  - Optionally, add details after a space following the handle.
